  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Public Financial Management through Information and Communication Technology and Skills (EFITS) 2 Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a follow-on operation of the E-FITS 1 project (P167534). It will finance activities initiated under E-FITS 1, namely the implementation of the new financial management information system (FMIS), procured under E-FITS 1, upgrade of the Debt Management and Financial Analysis System (DMFAS), and the implementation of the PFM skills program developed under E-FITS 1.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve efficiency and transparency of public financial management and strengthen capacity of public finance officials.</narrative>
  </description>
